# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
# trigger_tool: 出错的工具 (configure/cmake/meson/make/gcc/clang/ld/python/pip/install/test/runtime)
# phase:         出错阶段 (configuration/compilation/linking/installation/testing/runtime)
# error_signature: 正则表达式(|分隔), 用于精确匹配日志文本
id:                     E2026101615449
trigger_tool: python|flit_core|conan
phase: build|packaging
error_signature: bootstrap_install[.]py|backend-path|flit_core[.]buildapi|flit_core[.]wheel

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity: 2
category: python, packaging, bootstrap, install-destination
match_keywords: backend-path, build-system.requires, flit_core.buildapi, flit_core.wheel, bootstrap_install.py, --installdir, sysconfig.purelib, self-hosted backend
title: 源内PEP517 backend-path自举与官方bootstrap安装器显式目的地契约

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: A source-hosted PEP517 backend with empty build-system.requires can build its own wheel directly; its separate official bootstrap installer defaults to the running interpreter sysconfig purelib, which is independent of the Conan package destination. The source backend contract and explicit installer destination must be bound together.
affected_scope: Source-hosted PEP517 backend distributions with explicit backend-path and an official standalone bootstrap installer; external backends retain their declared dependency requirements.
verification_cmd: Actual target original7/219 inventory218 passed1 exact accepted guard,13 installed source hashes, installed backend wheel/sdist/editable C3, HMDFS/POSIX byte equality H1, two formal creates.

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: source-backend-wheel-entry-plus-official-installer-explicit-target
rec_description: 在既有Python源码自举规则上补充源内PEP517后端的双入口契约：先核对requires=[]、backend-path=["."]与flit_core.buildapi，直接用官方python -m flit_core.wheel生成自身wheel，再使用同一发布源bootstrap_install.py并显式传--installdir到Conan包内；该安装器默认目的地来自当前解释器sysconfig.purelib，不能靠Conan包目录自动改变默认值。安装前校验归档成员，安装后逐项匹配官方模块字节，并以安装后端构建wheel、sdist和editable产物验证完整元数据及RECORD。
rec_command: python -B -m flit_core.wheel --outdir <owned-dist>; python -B bootstrap_install.py <wheel> --installdir <Conan-package-site>
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Official unmodified source backend and bootstrap installer, explicit target directory, wheel member validation and installed-byte/RECORD checks.

